{
  "feature": "R4 PR A: Social and Settings bands drawn as the diamond head (handoff design_handoff_the99_deck_details_refresh, R4-Friends and R4-Settings)",
  "note": "Needs a signed-in account. Pods, Open links and Request history need the reader to have friends, a pod, an open link and a request history; the Store head needs STORE_PREFERENCE_ENABLED on for the reader. Waiting on you and Your requests are drawn bare (sr-only) inside the Requests box on /friends, the only route that draws them, so they have no visible band to photograph; their heads are held by unit tests.",
